  "description": "Adonis Icarus by Rayhaan is a clean, confident fragrance built around fresh citrus, aromatic herbs, and smooth woods, designed to project modern masculinity and effortless confidence. The opening is bright and energetic, with crisp citrus freshness that feels uplifting and sharp. The heart introduces aromatic and slightly spicy nuances, adding structure and masculine depth without heaviness. In the base, soft woods, amber, and musk provide a smooth, long-lasting finish that stays clean, refined, and wearable. Adonis Icarus is ideal for men who want a fresh, powerful, everyday signature that works in professional and social settings alike.",
